# kustomization.yaml wherever it lives, for a sharper reason than churn: Kubebuilder edits these
# in place at their `# +kubebuilder:scaffold:` markers and appends list entries at column 0, while
# Prettier indents a block sequence under a mapping key by two. One `kubebuilder create api` after
# one format run therefore leaves an indented item followed by a column-0 one, which is not valid
# YAML at all — "a block sequence may not be used as an implicit map key". The scaffolder's column
# 0 wins because it is the one doing the writing.
kustomization.yaml
